{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/minimumCut(capacity:)"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"minimumCut"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"capacity"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Flows3CutV","text":"Cut","identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/Cut"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">? "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18AdditiveArithmeticP","text":"AdditiveArithmetic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SL","text":"Comparable"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computed by Hao and Orlin’s algorithm: one push–relabel run that moves the sink through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every vertex, then the same on the reversed graph, covering cuts with the first vertex on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either side. Which minimum cut is returned when several exist is unspecified, but the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"input always gives the same cut. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"type":"text","text":" is called once per non-loop edge, in position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order, before any work."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sums are formed in a wider type than "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" where needed ("},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"Int128","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for fixed-width"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integers, "},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"code":"Float","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a vertex’s excess may exceed "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s range."}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(n²m) in the worst case."}]}],"name":"Complexity"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every capacity is at least zero, not NaN and finite, and the minimum cut’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value fits in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"Precondition"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Flows"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5FlowsE10minimumCut8capacityAD0F0Vyxqd__GSgqd__5Edges_5IndexQZXE_ts18AdditiveAri